{'symbol': 'KIM', 'date': '2022-07-05 06:50:00', 'title': 'KIMCO REALTY® PUBLISHES 2021 CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT', 'text': "JERICHO, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KIMCO REALTY® (NYSE: KIM), NORTH AMERICA'S LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED OWNER AND OPERATOR OF OPEN-AIR, GROCERY-ANCHORED SHOPPING CENTERS, INCLUDING MIXED-USE ASSETS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE RELEASE OF ITS 2021 CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT. THIS NINTH ANNUAL REPORT DETAILS THE COMPANY'S PERFORMANCE IN ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) AREAS. 2021 REPORT HIGHLIGHTS NOW OVER A DECADE SINCE THE LAUNCH OF KIMCO'S FORMALIZED EFFORTS AROUND ESG AND THE HIRE OF ITS"}